{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04875","headline":"奉和圣制送张尚书巡边 · 崔泰之","name":"奉和圣制送张尚书巡边","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南庭胡运尽，北斗将星飞。\n旗鼓临沙漠，旌旄出洛畿。\n关山遶玉塞，烽火映金微。\n屡献帷谋策，频承庙胜威。\n躞蹀临河骑，逶迤度陇旗。\n地脉平千古，天声振九围。\n车马生边气，戈鋋驻落晖。\n夏近蓬犹转，秋深草木腓。\n饯送纡天什，恩荣赐御衣。\n伫勒燕然颂，鸣驺计日归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔泰之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04875.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04875","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}